---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
	title="Sula Cafe | Chai & Coffee in East Vancouver"
	description="An East Vancouver coffee shop. Sula chai brewed slow from Coorg leaves, Alai Coffee blend, croissants baked daily. Drop by 260 East 5th Ave."
	canonical="/"
	ogImage="/uploads/2026/02/sula-cafe-near-me-vancouver.webp"
>

	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-content">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">From The Sula Indian Restaurant Team</span>
			<h1>Sip the moment.<br/><em>Taste the tradition.</em></h1>
			<div class="premium-divider">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p class="hero-tagline">A takeout <a href="/coffee-and-chai-in-vancouver" class="body-link">coffee shop in East Vancouver</a>. Authentic Sula chai, Alai Coffee, and bakery fresh every morning.</p>
			<div class="hero-buttons">
				<a href="https://www.order.store/store/sula-cafe/0egsttFCUIahN8Ja4Uqhtw" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</span>
					Order on UberEats
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="hero-image-band">
		<img src="/uploads/2026/02/sula-cafe-near-me-vancouver.webp" alt="Sula Chai Café storefront on East 5th Avenue, East Vancouver" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
	</div>

	<section class="section section-cream-reverse reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-img cocoa">
				<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-jaali"></div>
				<img src="/uploads/2026/02/chai-near-me-vancouver-sula-chai-cafe.webp" alt="Masala chai brewed at Sula Café in Vancouver with Coorg and Chikmagalur tea leaves" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				<div class="two-col-img-frame"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Sula Chai</span>
				<h2>Tea leaves from <em>Coorg & Chikmagalur.</em></h2>
				<div class="mini-divider">
					<div class="m-line"></div>
					<div class="m-diamond"></div>
					<div class="m-line"></div>
				</div>
				<p>The Scotland of India. Cool, misty highlands produce aromatic, full-bodied teas. Five blends, brewed slow with traditional spices. Want the longer story? Walk the <a href="/coffee-and-chai-in-vancouver" class="body-link">spice trail</a>.</p>
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag">Masala</span>
					<span class="tag">Lavender</span>
					<span class="tag">Pistachio</span>
					<span class="tag">Gulabi</span>
					<span class="tag">Spicy Ginger</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-tan reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Alai Coffee Partnership</span>
				<h2>Crafted by <em>Alai.</em> Brewed at <em>Sula.</em></h2>
				<div class="mini-divider">
					<div class="m-line"></div>
					<div class="m-diamond"></div>
					<div class="m-line"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Our Exclusive Sula Blend by <a href="https://alaicoffee.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="body-link">Alai Coffee</a>. Single-origin from Chikmagalur and Odisha. Specialty coffee inspired by Indian dessert traditions.</p>
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Jaggery Velvet Latte</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Coastal Coconut Cap</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Malai Pista Mocha</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Indian Filter Coffee</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-img espresso">
				<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-block"></div>
				<img src="/uploads/2026/02/alai-coffee-vancouver.webp" alt="Alai Coffee Sula Blend, specialty coffee roasted in Vancouver from Chikmagalur and Odisha beans" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				<div class="two-col-img-frame"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-corner tl"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-corner br"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream reveal">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Our Baked Goods</span>
				<h2>Indian neighborhood bakeries, with a <em>Vancouver twist.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Spiced cookies, chai-infused cakes, paninis on house-made masala focaccia. Fresh every morning. Slow-laminated. We've been writing about <a href="/blog/pastries-coffee-pairing" class="body-link">pairings and pastries</a> over in the journal.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<a href="/menu#savory" class="photo-card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/10/Pesto-chicken-tikka-panini.webp" alt="Pesto chicken tikka panini on house-made masala focaccia at Sula Café Vancouver" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Masala Focaccia</span>
						<h3>Paneer & Chicken <em>Paninis</em></h3>
						<p>Chimichurri paneer. Pesto chicken tikka. Pressed in masala focaccia from Union Market.</p>
					</div>
				</a>

				<a href="/menu#sweets" class="photo-card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/10/Coconut-lime-cruffin.webp" alt="Lime coconut cruffin and fresh-baked pastries from Sula Café in East Vancouver" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Sweet Pastries</span>
						<h3>Cruffins & <em>Croissants</em></h3>
						<p>Lime coconut. Tiramisu. Orange chocolate pain suisse. Pistachio loaf. All baked daily.</p>
					</div>
				</a>

				<a href="/menu#cookies" class="photo-card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/10/cafe-near-me-vancouver.webp" alt="Brown butter espresso cookies and macaroons at Sula Café Vancouver" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Cookies & Treats</span>
						<h3>Cookies & <em>Macaroons</em></h3>
						<p>Brown butter espresso. Pistachio malai. Chocolate chip. Plus samosas with chutneys.</p>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-espresso reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">Catering & Events</span>
			<h2>Bring Sula <em>to your gathering.</em></h2>
			<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p style="max-width:680px;margin:24px auto 36px">Live chai bars, specialty coffee, and bakery boxes for weddings, corporate events, and private parties. We also do <a href="/wholesale" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">wholesale</a> for cafés and offices.</p>
			<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
				<a href="/catering" class="cta">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</span>
					Explore Catering
				</a>
				<a href="/wholesale" class="btn-outline-cream">
					<span class="btn-badge">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</span>
					Wholesale Bakery
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-deep reveal" id="faq">
		<div class="container container-narrow">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Common Questions</span>
				<h2>Things people <em>often ask.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Quick answers from the team behind the counter.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="faq-list">
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Where are you located?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>260 East 5th Avenue in East Vancouver, just off Main Street. Easy to spot, easier to find a chai you'll actually remember.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">What are your hours?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Open daily. Monday through Friday from 8am to 5:30pm, weekends 9am to 5:30pm.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Is Sula Café takeout only?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Yes. We're built for grab-and-go. There's a few seats inside if you want to sit with your cup, but the vibe is takeout first.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Do you offer catering?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>We do. Live chai bars, specialty coffee, fresh-baked pastries, and bakery boxes for offices, weddings, and private parties. See our <a href="/catering">catering for events in Vancouver</a>.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Can I order online?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Yes, we're on UberEats. Full menu, delivery to your door. Or call ahead and we'll have it ready for pickup.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">What chai blends do you serve?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Five blends, each brewed slow with whole spices. Classic masala, lavender, pistachio, spicy ginger, and gulabi rose. Browse our <a href="/menu">specialty chai in Vancouver</a> menu for the full list.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Do you have vegan or gluten-free options?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Plenty. Our vegan options span chai (just ask for oat or coconut milk), pastries, and a sugar-free morning glory muffin. Gluten-free items available too, just ask the team.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Is there parking?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Free street parking on East 5th. Paid lots nearby on Main Street. Cycling? We've got racks out front.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script type="application/ld+json" slot="schema" set:html={JSON.stringify({
		"@context": "https://schema.org",
		"@type": "FAQPage",
		"mainEntity": [
			{
				"@type": "Question",
				"name": "Where are you located?",
				"acceptedAnswer": {
					"@type": "Answer",
					"text": "260 East 5th Avenue in East Vancouver, just off Main Street. Easy to spot, easier to find a chai you'll actually remember."
				}
			},
			{
				"@type": "Question",
				"name": "What are your hours?",
				"acceptedAnswer": {
					"@type": "Answer",
					"text": "Open daily. Monday through Friday from 8am to 5:30pm, weekends 9am to 5:30pm."
				}
			},
			{
				"@type": "Question",
				"name": "Is Sula Café takeout only?",
				"acceptedAnswer": {
					"@type": "Answer",
					"text": "Yes. We're built for grab-and-go. There's a few seats inside if you want to sit with your cup, but the vibe is takeout first."
				}
			},
			{
				"@type": "Question",
				"name": "Do you offer catering?",
				"acceptedAnswer": {
					"@type": "Answer",
					"text": "We do. Live chai bars, specialty coffee, fresh-baked pastries, and bakery boxes for offices, weddings, and private parties. See our catering for events in Vancouver."
				}
			},
			{
				"@type": "Question",
				"name": "Can I order online?",
				"acceptedAnswer": {
					"@type": "Answer",
					"text": "Yes, we're on UberEats. Full menu, delivery to your door. Or call ahead and we'll have it ready for pickup."
				}
			},
			{
				"@type": "Question",
				"name": "What chai blends do you serve?",
				"acceptedAnswer": {
					"@type": "Answer",
					"text": "Five blends, each brewed slow with whole spices. Classic masala, lavender, pistachio, spicy ginger, and gulabi rose. Browse our specialty chai in Vancouver menu for the full list."
				}
			},
			{
				"@type": "Question",
				"name": "Do you have vegan or gluten-free options?",
				"acceptedAnswer": {
					"@type": "Answer",
					"text": "Plenty. Our vegan options span chai (just ask for oat or coconut milk), pastries, and a sugar-free morning glory muffin. Gluten-free items available too, just ask the team."
				}
			},
			{
				"@type": "Question",
				"name": "Is there parking?",
				"acceptedAnswer": {
					"@type": "Answer",
					"text": "Free street parking on East 5th. Paid lots nearby on Main Street. Cycling? We've got racks out front."
				}
			}
		]
	})} />

	<section class="section section-cocoa reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">Visit Us</span>
			<h2>Find us in <em>East Vancouver.</em></h2>
			<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="visit-info">
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Address</div>
					<div class="value">260 East 5th Ave</div>
				</div>
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Service</div>
					<div class="value">Takeout · UberEats</div>
				</div>
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Call</div>
					<div class="value">778-386-1130</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:50px">
				<a href="https://www.order.store/store/sula-cafe/0egsttFCUIahN8Ja4Uqhtw" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</span>
					Order on UberEats
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
